{"availability":"available","full":"snehkr/Repo-Readme-Creator","name":"Repo-Readme-Creator","description":"Repository readme generator is a tool that allows you to create simple and beautiful readme for your repository that you can copy/paste/download.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2022-05-09T08:47:48Z","updated":"2025-09-02T18:03:45Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://repo-readme.netlify.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://repo-readme.netlify.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:32.531Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:32.531Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:32.531Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T23:19:32.531Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Craft beautiful, professional READMEs with live preview and powerful features.","Repo README Creator is a standalone, browser-based tool that provides a modern, efficient, and enjoyable experience for creating professional README files. It's a complete overhaul of the original concept, rebuilt from the ground up with a modern tech stack and a focus on an excellent user experience.","With a real-time preview, section templates, and automatic saving, you can craft the perfect README for your project in a fraction of the time."],"features":["Modern Tech Stack: Built with Vue 3 (Composition API) for a reactive and performant experience.","🎨 Refreshed UI/UX: A clean, responsive design styled with Tailwind CSS, including a beautiful dark mode.","💾 State Persistence: Your work is automatically saved to your browser's local storage. Never lose your progress on a refresh!","🚀 Section Templates: Quickly add common sections like \"Features,\" \"API Reference,\" or \"License\" from a pre-filled list.","🔒 Secure Live Preview: See your rendered Markdown in real-time. The preview is sanitized with DOMPurify for enhanced security."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/snehkr/Re